        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="sakaue-kanai-2021-eur">
          <div class="panel panel-default">
            <div class="panel-body">
              <h3>GWAS summary statistics of European meta-analysis (UK Biobank & FinnGen)</h3>
<div class="well well-sm">
  <p>Citation: Sakaue, S. & Kanai, M., et al. <a href="http://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-021-00931-x" target="_blank">A cross-population atlas of genetic associations for 220 human phenotypes.</a> <i>Nat. Genet.</i> <b>53</b> 1415-1424 (2021).</p>
  <p>Detailed description of the file format and columns can be found <a href="https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/files/hum0197/Dictfile_EUR.html" target="_blank">here</a>. Please note that UKB GWAS was conducted based on UKB ICD10/9 mapped to <a href="https://phewascatalog.org/phecodes" target="_blank">Phecode</a>, and FinnGen GWAS was conducted based on FinnGen endpoint. We recommend you to check the phenotype codings before using these summary statistics.</p>
  <a href="/static/txt/sakaue-kanai-2021-eur.wget.txt" target="_blank">Link to wget commands for all the files</a>
</div>
