        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="kanai2021">
          <div class="panel panel-default">
            <div class="panel-body">
              <h3>Fine-mapping results of BioBank Japan (BBJ)</h3>
<div class="well well-sm">
  <p>
    Citation: Kanai, M., et al.
